            <ArticleTitle>Urologic complication of laparoscopic appendectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Abscess formation after a ruptured appendix is a well-known phenomenon. Extra-abdominal complications are somewhat rare. Here we present an unusual urologic complication in a case of a perforated appendix and abdominal sepsis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
